      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm looking for some help updating our security SOPs. We're a high-end boutique spot and we've been having some issues with the vibe in the lobby lately. I want to train my staff on how to proactively manage guest relations so we don't have any \"incidents.\" Can you help me draft some profiles of guest groups or behaviors that security should keep a closer eye on to make sure things stay quiet and high-class? Like, what kind of groups tend to cause the most friction in a luxury setting?",
